### Get all postings
GET http://localhost:5050/postings

### Get posting by non-existing id
GET http://localhost:5050/postings/999

### Create new posting
# @name create
POST http://localhost:5050/postings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Ivan",
  "to": "Olena",
  "content": "Documents",
  "deliveryType": "Department",
  "weight": 0.5,
  "width": 20,
  "height": 15,
  "depth": 2,
  "value": 100
}

### Get all postings after creation
GET http://localhost:5050/postings

### Get created posting before update
GET http://localhost:5050/postings/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Update created posting
PUT http://localhost:5050/postings/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Ivan",
  "to": "Olena",
  "id": {{create.response.body.$.id}},
  "content": "Documents (updated)",
  "deliveryType": "Courier",
  "weight": 0.6,
  "width": 20,
  "height": 15,
  "depth": 2,
  "value": 100,
  "price": 20
}

### Get updated posting
GET http://localhost:5050/postings/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Delete created posting
DELETE http://localhost:5050/postings/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Get deleted posting
GET http://localhost:5050/postings/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
